      "text": "Request flow:\n  1) Browser → Next.js  GET /            (renders SPA: page.tsx + ItemsClient.tsx)\n  2) Browser → Next.js  GET /config.js   (runtime config → window.__APP_CONFIG__.pythonApiBaseUrl)\n  3) Browser → FastAPI  /hello, /items, POST /items, DELETE /items/{id}    (called directly from the browser, CORS enabled)\n  4) FastAPI  → Spring  /api/items  via httpx, then maps response and adds derived  display_name\n  5) Spring   → SQLite  via Spring Data JPA (embedded items.db, path overridable by SQLITE_PATH)\nHealth probes:  /healthz (Next.js)   /health (FastAPI)   /health (Spring)",
